  "job_B1.4.3_20251001_193239": {
    "chunk_text": "We habba\u00f0 anfealdlice ges\u00e6d eow nu \u00feis godspell, and we willa\u00f0 geopnian eow \u00fe\u00e6t andgyt nu, for \u00f0am Se hiredes ealdor witudlice \u00fee h\u00e6fde \u00feone wineard is se heofonlica God, \u00fee h\u00e6fde gelogod \u00fea \u00dea het God hi oft \u00feurh his halgan witegan wineardes naman, for \u00feam \u00f0e hi wyrcan sceoldon gode Be \u00feam winearde cw\u00e6\u00f0 se witega Isaias: Ic abad \u00fe\u00e6t min wineard b\u00e6re me w\u00e6stmas, and he \u00fea Godes wineard so\u00f0lice is Israhela hiwr\u00e6den, and ic abad heora \u00fe\u00e6t hi worhton dom, and efne hi Rihtwisnysse ic abad, and hi worhton hream: \u00feis s\u00e6de se witega be \u00feam unges\u00e6ligum Iudeum. \u00deone wineard he behegode, \u00fe\u00e6t is Israhela folc, mid m\u00e6rlicum burgum, and mid engla hyrdr\u00e6dena. Se stypel \u00fee he getimbrode, \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t st\u00e6nene tempel \u00fee se snotera Salomon gesette on Hierusalem God bet\u00e6hte \u00feone wineard \u00feam wisum bocerum and \u00feam Sunderhalgum \u00fee heoldon his \u00e6, \u00fe\u00e6t hi him Manega \u00fe\u00e6r ge\u00feugon of \u00f0am mancynne Gode, \u00feeah \u00fee hi sume unges\u00e6lige w\u00e6ron, and Crist forsawon, He cidde eac him, and on sumne s\u00e6l cw\u00e6\u00f0, Wa eow bocerum and eow Sunderhalgum, ge hiweras \u00fee Ge teo\u00f0ia\u00f0 eowre wyrta, and witudlice forl\u00e6ta\u00f0 \u00fea maran beboda \u00fee eow bebyt seo \u00e6, rihtne dom and \u00deas \u00feing gedafenode so\u00f0lice to donne,",
